@startuml OnboardingPlacement
title Onboarding and Placement Sequence Diagram

actor Learner
boundary "Onboarding UI" as UI
control "Profile / Placement API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
control "Recommendation Engine" as REC

Learner -> UI: Enter goals, kana level,\ndaily time, topics
UI -> API: Submit learner profile
API -> API: Validate profile data
API -> DB: Store learner profile
DB --> API: Profile saved
API --> UI: Return onboarding result
UI --> Learner: Ask whether to take placement test

Learner -> UI: Start placement test
UI -> API: Request placement questions
API -> DB: Load N5 questions\nand profile context
DB --> API: Return questions
API --> UI: Display placement questions
Learner -> UI: Submit answers
UI -> API: Submit placement answers
API -> API: Calculate placement result
API -> DB: Store placement result
API -> REC: Update initial recommendations
REC -> DB: Read profile and placement data
REC --> API: Return recommended actions
API --> UI: Return updated learning path
UI --> Learner: Show next recommended step

@enduml

@startuml LearningPathRecommendation
title Learning Path Recommendation Sequence Diagram

actor Learner
boundary "Learning Path UI" as UI
control "Recommendation API" as API
control "Recommendation Engine" as REC
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

Learner -> UI: Open learning path
UI -> API: Request recommendations
API -> REC: Generate recommendations
REC -> DB: Load learner profile
REC -> DB: Load placement result
REC -> DB: Load vocabulary and grammar progress
REC -> DB: Load quiz attempts
REC -> DB: Load activity logs
REC -> REC: Calculate priority, mastery,\nrisk, and reasons
REC --> API: Return ranked learning actions
API --> UI: Return learning path tasks
UI --> Learner: Display tasks with reasons\nand estimated time
Learner -> UI: Select a task
UI --> Learner: Navigate to selected session

@enduml

@startuml ChatbotRAG
title Chatbot RAG Sequence Diagram

actor Learner
boundary "Chat UI" as UI
control "Chat API" as API
control "RAG Retriever" as RAG
database "Knowledge Chunks" as DB
participant "AI Provider" as AI

Learner -> UI: Ask a learning question
UI -> API: Send chat message
API -> RAG: Retrieve relevant sources
RAG -> DB: Query top-k knowledge chunks
DB --> RAG: Return chunks and metadata
RAG --> API: Return sources
API -> API: Build grounded prompt
API -> AI: Request AI completion
AI --> API: Return generated answer
API -> DB: Store chat log
API --> UI: Return answer and sources
UI --> Learner: Display Kami response

alt Missing AI configuration or embedding data
  API -> RAG: Run keyword fallback
  RAG -> DB: Search matching content
  DB --> RAG: Return fallback sources
  RAG --> API: Return fallback context
  API --> UI: Return fallback response
end

@enduml

@startuml QuizSubmission
title Quiz Submission Sequence Diagram

actor Learner
boundary "Quiz UI" as UI
control "Quiz API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
control "Recommendation Engine" as REC

Learner -> UI: Open quiz
UI -> API: Request quiz questions
API -> DB: Load questions and answers
DB --> API: Return quiz data
API --> UI: Display quiz
Learner -> UI: Select answers and submit
UI -> API: Submit quiz attempt
API -> API: Calculate score and explanations
API -> DB: Store quiz attempt
API -> DB: Write activity log
API -> REC: Update mastery evidence
REC -> DB: Read latest quiz attempts\nand progress
REC --> API: Return updated signals
API --> UI: Return score, explanations,\nand next suggestions
UI --> Learner: Display quiz result

@enduml
